    <h2>5. Role-Based Access Control & Functional Workflows</h2>

    <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>User Role</th>
                <th>Default Credentials</th>
                <th>Accessible Screens & Functional Capabilities</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Receptionist</b><br>(Front Desk)</td>
                <td><code>receptionist1</code><br><code>receptionist123</code></td>
                <td>
                    • <b>Smart Patient Intake:</b> First-time New Patient registration or Existing Patient lookup.<br>
                    • <b>Appointment Booking:</b> Clinician selection, conflict check, and automatic serial generation.<br>
                    • <b>Display Appointment:</b> Search by <code>APT-</code> number to view clinical history.<br>
                    • <b>Calculate &amp; Print Bill:</b> MySQL stored procedure invoicing with hardware and digital receipt print.<br>
                    • <b>Daily Schedule:</b> Calendar filtering for daily appointments.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Dentist</b><br>(Dental Surgeon)</td>
                <td><code>dr.silva</code> / <code>dr.perera</code><br><code>dr.fernando</code> / <code>abi</code></td>
                <td>
                    • <b>Dentist Dashboard:</b> Clinical queue filtered strictly to the logged-in doctor's patients.<br>
                    • <b>Clinical Examination &amp; Diagnosis:</b> Revise diagnosed treatment procedure, record clinical findings/notes, and set status to <code>IN PROGRESS</code> or <code>COMPLETED</code>.<br>
                    • <b>Dynamic Tariff Update:</b> Doctor's diagnosis directly updates procedure fees in billing.<br>
                    • <b>Strict Segregation:</b> Financial billing controls are hidden for clean clinical workflow.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Administrator</b><br>(Executive)</td>
                <td><code>admin</code><br><code>admin123</code></td>
                <td>
                    • <b>Executive Overview:</b> Total Appointments, Today's Clinic Revenue, and Active Clinicians (<b>4 Dentists</b>).<br>
                    • <b>Master Audit Stream:</b> Full audit access to all clinic appointments.<br>
                    • <b>Staff Management (CRUD):</b> Register new Receptionists, Dentists, or Admins with automatic specialization validation.<br>
                    • <b>Treatment Tariff Catalog (CRUD):</b> Add/remove clinical dental procedures and official prices.<br>
                    • <b>Financial Analytics:</b> Revenue By Treatment and Top Procedure volume rankings.
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

