    <h3>7.2 Automated CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions)</h3>
    <p>
        The repository is configured with an enterprise-grade GitHub Actions CI/CD workflow defined in <code>.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml</code>. Whenever changes are pushed to the <code>master</code> branch, the automated pipeline performs the following end-to-end integration and delivery stages:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><b>1. Environment Provisioning:</b> Spins up an <code>ubuntu-latest</code> virtual runner with <b>JDK 21 (Eclipse Temurin)</b> and an ephemeral <b>MySQL 8.0</b> service container.</li>
        <li><b>2. Automated Database Initialization:</b> Ingests <code>database/schema.sql</code>, generating all tables, indexes, triggers, and stored routines.</li>
        <li><b>3. Continuous Integration (CI Test Suite):</b> Executes <code>mvn clean test</code> across all DAO, Service, and Integration test classes to ensure zero regressions.</li>
        <li><b>4. Continuous Delivery (CD Packaging):</b> Compiles and packages the production distribution executable <code>SunriseDentalClinic.jar</code>.</li>
        <li><b>5. Artifact Publishing:</b> Deploys the built JAR as a downloadable GitHub Actions build artifact with 30-day retention for instant release deployment.</li>
    </ul>

    <pre>
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  GITHUB ACTIONS CI/CD PIPELINE FLOW                                                    │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Developer Git Push to master]                                                        │
│           │                                                                            │
│           ▼                                                                            │
│  [GitHub Actions Runner: ubuntu-latest] ──> Spin up live MySQL 8.0 Database Container   │
│           │                                                                            │
│           ▼                                                                            │
│  [Step 1: Ingest database/schema.sql]    ──> Tables, Triggers &amp; Stored Procedures Active│
│           │                                                                            │
│           ▼                                                                            │
│  [Step 2: Maven Automated Test Suite]    ──> 29 JUnit Tests Pass (CI Verified)         │
│           │                                                                            │
│           ▼                                                                            │
│  [Step 3: Package Distribution JAR]      ──> SunriseDentalClinic-v1.0.jar (CD Output)  │
│           │                                                                            │
│           ▼                                                                            │
│  [Step 4: Upload Release Artifact]       ──> Available for Public Download &amp; Deploy    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    </pre>

